{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">WIDGET-HANDLE function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310938","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/WIDGET-HANDLE-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/WIDGET-HANDLE-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"WIDGET-HANDLE-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">WIDGET-HANDLE function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"WIDGET-HANDLE-function__section_N10031_N1002E_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">This function is supported only for backward\ncompatibility. Use the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"HANDLE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/HANDLE-function.html\">HANDLE function</a> instead.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Converts\na string representation of a handle to a valid handle. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"WIDGET-HANDLE-function__syntax_GC1C1EG2706432\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d210706e110\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"WIDGET-HANDLE-function__idGDQ3322678473\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>WIDGET-HANDLE ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle-string</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <div class=\"note caution note_caution\" id=\"WIDGET-HANDLE-function__note_N10081_N10047_N1002E_N10001\"><span class=\"note__title\">CAUTION:</span> Use this function only to\nconvert a handle previously stored as a string value back to a valid\nhandle. If you convert an arbitrary string to handle using this\nfunction and then reference the new handle, a system error will\noccur. If you use the VALID-HANDLE function to validate a handle\ngenerated from an arbitrary string value, a system error will occur.</div>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle-string</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">\n            <p class=\"p\">A string representation of a handle. Since handles are integer values,\nthe string must contain only numeric characters.</p>\n          </dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"WEEKDAY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/WEEKDAY-function.html\">WEEKDAY function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Widget-phrase.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Widget-phrase.html\">Widget phrase</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310938","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"WIDGET-HANDLE function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/WIDGET-HANDLE-function.html","type":"Manual"}